Firmware (firmware/)
--------------------
GxEPD2 - GPL-3.0
  E-paper display library, linked by the firmware at build time (not copied into this repository).
ArduinoJson - MIT
  JSON library, linked by the firmware at build time (not copied into this repository).

The firmware source code in this repository is MIT. A compiled firmware binary links GxEPD2,
so a binary is distributed under GPL-3.0 as a whole. This repository publishes source code
only and no binaries. Anyone who builds and distributes a binary must follow the GPL-3.0
(provide the corresponding source code and the license text).

Fonts (server/fonts/)
---------------------
DejaVu Sans and DejaVu Sans Bold - Bitstream Vera and Arev licenses; DejaVu changes are public domain
  License text: server/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt
Terminus (bitmap, normal and bold) - OFL-1.1 (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  License text: server/fonts/LICENSE-Terminus.txt

The font files are not modified. More details: server/fonts/README.md.
